cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "In-app purchases, ratings and widgets of iPhone step counters"
abstract: "A hand-made survey of iPhone step counter apps on the US App Store. In-app purchase prices were read off each app's own store page, because Apple's search interface does not report them. Ratings, widget mentions and last-updated months come from the same listings. No app was ranked or scored; this is what the store showed on the date below."
authors:
  - name: "Angel Step"
    website: "https://angelstep.app"
date-released: 2026-08-17
url: "https://angelstep.app/data"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
